me_icon_%28February_2022%29.svg/250px-Google_Chrome_icon_%28February_2022%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="The Google Chrome logo, a blue circle surrounded by a thicker band that contains three colored segments. The outer band is red, yellow, and green." data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" data-file-type="drawing" height="120" width="120" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span><div class="infobox-caption">Logo used since March 2022</div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" class="infobox-image logo"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Google_Chrome_on_Windows_10_screenshot.png" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Google_Chrome_on_Windows_10_screenshot.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/51/Google_Chrome_on_Windows_10_screenshot.png/250px-Google_Chrome_on_Windows_10_screenshot.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/51/Google_Chrome_on_Windows_10_screenshot.png/500px-Google_Chrome_on_Windows_10_screenshot.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="This is a screenshot of the Chrome browser. The browser has one tab open. The website opened in the browser is English Wikipedia's main page." data-file-width="640" data-file-height="480" data-file-type="bitmap" height="188" width="250" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span><div class="infobox-caption">Screenshot of Google Chrome on <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Windows_10" title="Windows 10">Windows 10</a>, showing the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Main_Page" title="Main Page">Main Page</a> of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_Wikipedia" title="English Wikipedia">English Wikipedia</a></div></td></tr><tr><th scope="row