<li id="mwGrU"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLNYkxOF6rcIDz1TzmmMRBC-kd8zPRTQIP" class="external text" id="mwGrY"><b id="mwGrc">Google I/O 2016</b> – Web and Chrome at Google I/O 2016</a> — dedicated playlist and many Chrome/web sessions</li>
<li id="mwGrg"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLOU2XLYxmsIKC8eODk_RNCWv3fBcLvMMy" class="external text" id="mwGrk"><b id="mwGro">Google I/O 2017</b> – I/O 2017 all-sessions playlist + many Chrome/web technical talks</a>.</li>
