<li id="mwGr8"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLOU2XLYxmsILw2VmhxUWyd_imCrJef_iz" class="external text" id="mwGsA"><b id="mwGsE">Google I/O 2022</b> — <b id="mwGsI">All Google I/O 2022 Sessions</b></a> and playlists include Web/Chrome updates – see the I/O 2022 sessions playlist and the "Web" track.</li>
<li id="mwGsM"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLNYkxOF6rcICFB5ejR8ezf2pglcfA6HAo" class="external text" id="mwGsQ"><b id="mwGsU">Google I/O 2023</b> — ChromeOS and Web playlists</a> (dedicated ChromeOS playlist and Web sessions for I/O 2023).</li>
<li id="mwGsY"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLOU2XLYxmsIJQPs-2nnII-n59vYoxKsmq" class="external text" id="mwGsc"><b id="mwGsg">Google I/O 2024</b> — All sessions</a> (I/O 2024) and a "Web at I/O 2024" playlist highlighting Chrome and web platform updates.</li>
<li id="mwGsk"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://io.google/2025/" class="external text" id="mwGso"><b id="mwGss">Google I/O 2025</b> — I/O 2025</a> explore page and the <b id="mwGsw">All Sessions (2025)</b> playlist — includes the Web track and Chrome/ChromeOS sessions (privacy, performance, DevTools, AI features in the browser).</li></ul>
